OL,3,GNEWSA'Lack of detail and serious
OL,4,Aconcerns' over Scottish government bus
OL,5,Aplans
OL,6,
OL,7,FA trade association which represents
OL,8,Fbus companies has said there are
OL,9,Fserious questions over the Scottish
OL,10,Fgovernment's plans to bring the bus
OL,11,Fnetwork under public control.
OL,13,FPaul White, director of the
OL,14,FConfederation of Passenger Transport
OL,15,F(CPT) in Scotland, said the first
OL,16,Fminister announced "a policy statement
OL,17,Fbut no detail behind it".
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,428,420,260,160,0,100
