OL,3,GNEWSA'Lack of detail and serious
OL,4,Aconcerns' over Scottish government bus
OL,5,Aplans
OL,6,
OL,7,F"We need to know what is meant by
OL,8,Fpublic control and how it will impact
OL,9,Fexisting legislation and bus
OL,10,Fpartnerships across the country before
OL,11,Fwe can form a view," he added.
OL,13,FSpeaking on BBC Scotland's Sunday Show,
OL,14,FDeputy First Minister Jenny Gilruth
OL,15,Fsaid her government was "protecting"
OL,16,Fthe public, who had faced a series of
OL,17,Froute closures in recent years.
